cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GEM1: A Confidence-Aware Framework for Genome-Scale Metabolic Signature Discovery"
abstract: >-
  GEM1 integrates genome-scale metabolic modeling (GSMM) with probabilistic
  flux uncertainty estimation, cross-reconstruction-algorithm consensus, and
  a hierarchical, empirically-calibrated confidence score, to rank candidate
  disease biomarkers by reproducibility and robustness across independent
  cohorts and reconstruction methods. Demonstrated using NAFLD/MASLD as a
  case study.
